---
layout: layouts/base.njk
titolo_seo: Riccardo Vojvoda - Sound Designer and Audio Post-Producer | Italy
descrizione_seo: Sound design and audio post-production for film, documentary, branded content, animation, video games and immersive installations. Portfolio with Maserati, Alfa Romeo, Diadora, The North Face and other international brands.
classeBody: home
chiave: home
permalink: /en/
---
<section class="eroe">
  <div class="contenitore eroe-griglia">
    <div class="eroe-testo">
      <h1>RICCARDO VOJVODA</h1>
      <p class="eroe-ruolo">Sound Designer | Audio Post-Producer</p>
      <p class="eroe-intro">Production sound and audio post-production for video productions, communication agencies, filmmakers, directors and artists. Film, documentary, branded content, corporate and institutional video, animation and motion graphics, video games, radio spots: layered sound design, stereo and surround mixing, music selection and composition, synthetic voice direction, ADR and location sound with a full kit.</p>
      <p class="eroe-nota">Remote work in English, French and Italian.<br>For shoots, on location in Italy and abroad.</p>
      <div class="eroe-azioni">
        <a class="bottone" href="#projects">See the projects</a>
        <a class="bottone bottone-secondario" href="/en/contact/">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="eroe-reel">
      {% set v = { youtube: sito.showreel.youtube, titolo: "Showreel 2026 - Sound Design RV", durata: sito.showreel.durata } %}
      {% set poster = sito.showreel.poster %}
      {% set eager = true %}
      {% include "parti/video.njk" %}
      <nav class="capitoli" aria-label="Showreel chapters" data-video-capitoli>
        <p class="capitoli-titolo"><span>In the reel</span> <small>Pick a chapter or start from the top</small></p>
        <ol class="capitoli-lista">
          {%- for c in sito.showreel.capitoli %}
          <li><button type="button" data-capitolo="{{ c.t }}" aria-label="{{ c.titolo }}, from {{ c.t | tempo }}"><span class="capitoli-nome">{{ c.titolo }}</span><span class="capitoli-tempo">{{ c.t | tempo }}</span></button></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="clienti" aria-labelledby="clienti-titolo">
  <div class="contenitore">
    <h2 id="clienti-titolo" class="etichetta">Brands and productions</h2>
    <ul class="loghi">
      {%- for l in sito.loghi %}
      <li><img src="/assets/img/loghi/{{ l[0] }}" alt="{{ l[1] }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150" height="75"></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="progetti" aria-label="Portfolio">
  <h2 class="visivamente-nascosto">Portfolio</h2>
  {%- asyncEach p in collections.progetti_en %}
  <article class="progetto {{ p.data.tema | slugTema }}" id="{{ p.fileSlug }}">
    <div class="contenitore progetto-griglia">
      <div class="progetto-media">
        {% set v = p.data.video[0] %}
        {% set poster = "progetti/" + p.data.immagine %}
        {% set eager = false %}
        {% include "parti/video.njk" %}
        {%- if p.data.video.length > 1 %}
        <p class="progetto-altri"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.video.length }} videos in this series</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="progetto-testo">
        <p class="progetto-frase">{{ p.data.frase }}</p>
        <h3 class="progetto-brand"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.brand }}</a></h3>
        <p class="progetto-titolo">{{ p.data.titolo }}</p>
        <p class="progetto-crediti">{{ p.data.crediti }}</p>
        <div class="progetto-descrizione">{{ p.rawInput | md | safe }}</div>
        <p class="progetto-meta"><span>Category: {{ p.data.categoria }}</span> <span>Role: {{ p.data.ruolo }}</span></p>
        <a class="progetto-link" href="{{ p.url }}">Project page</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  {%- endeach %}
</section>

<section class="dietro tema-jet" aria-labelledby="dietro-titolo">
  <div class="contenitore">
    <h2 id="dietro-titolo">BEHIND THE SOUND DESIGN</h2>
    <p>A look behind the scenes: sessions, stems and before/after comparisons, headphones on. On Instagram, <a href="{{ sito.social.instagram }}" rel="me noopener">@sound_design_rv</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="dietro-strip" aria-label="Behind the sound design reel covers">
    {%- asyncEach i in range(1, 13) %}
    <li>{% img "behind/earbuds-on-" + ("0" + i if i < 10 else i) + ".jpg", "Behind the sound design reel, cover " + i, "(min-width: 60em) 12vw, 40vw" %}</li>
    {%- endeach %}
  </ul>
</section>
